-```
-amort = depShoot + depOffice + depSoft + depWs + eduY + siteY
-  depShoot=107 760  (Form001), depOffice=65 733 (Form002), depSoft=11 500 (Form004)
-  depWs=9 286 (Form013), eduY=74 409 (80 000 + 4 мес × 110 216) / 7 лет, siteY=10 000 (70 000/7)
-vari  = varSoft + varAds + varBank + varAcc + wsY
